  "description": "Spring is the season of cherry blossoms and pink petals falling to the ground… But one of those petals lands on Melody and colors her whole world pink. She falls in love at first sight with a worker at a café, but just when she gathers enough courage to confess, he disappears... and reappears at the most unexpected place and time. Is this the long arm of coincidence? Or is it fate?\n\n(Source: Spottoon)",
